	(text "BOARD 2 - U23 LSM6DSK320X secondary IMU (high-g): dedicated hardware SPI1 (4-wire, GPIO8/10/11, CS GPIO9). Powered from V3V3_ANA."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 10 7 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "e4a434b5-9fc1-5d2a-8f1c-9cdd8044c9c6")
	)
	(text "U23 LSM6DSK320X on its own SPI1 bus, ST DS15060 Rev 1.\nMode 1, SPI 4-wire: SCL/SPC = IMU2_SCK, SDA/SDI = IMU2_MOSI, SDO/TA0 = IMU2_MISO, CS = IMU2_CS,\nINT1 = IMU2_INT1 (GPIO7), INT2 = IMU2_INT2 (GPIO6).\nTable 2 / Figure 27: SDx (pin 2) and SCx (pin 3) connect to VDDIO or GND - SDx to V3V3_ANA, SCx to GND here;\nOCS_aux (pin 10) and SDO_aux (pin 11) are left unconnected (\"electrically unconnected and soldered to PCB\").\nDecoupling per Figure 27: 100 nF on VDD (C59) and 100 nF on VDDIO (C60), close to the pins.\nVDD 1.71-3.6 V and VDDIO 1.08-3.6 V, both on V3V3_ANA. CS has an internal pull-up; R51 keeps CS high while the\nMCU is in reset. Firmware: set I2C_I3C_disable = 1 in IF_CFG (03h) for SPI-only operation.\nLow-g channel +/-2..16 g, high-g channel +/-32..320 g, gyroscope +/-250..4000 dps."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 10 150 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "f4ea28a5-e479-5ce6-947d-44306223dcac")
	)
